*   **Schedule SE:** To calculate the Social Security and Medicare taxes on your net photography income.
*   **Student Loan Interest Deduction Worksheet:** Found in the Form 1040 instructions to calculate exactly how much of the $2,500 max you can claim based on the phase-out.

